I can help you draft the code. A resolver grabs the query from the root, locates the next domain in the hierarchy, and appends the full domain to the root before forwarding it to the TLD. The code would look like:

```perl
sub route_dn {
    my ($self, $query, $next_domain, $query_suffix) = @_;
    return $next_domain + $query_suffix;
}
